// IntroString :
"P3065092691" "Ghost Widow's spy managed to escape those Longbow agents on Sharkhead, mainly because we showed in time to drive them off. The spy had information on key researchers into inter-dimensional portal technology, which is going to be big-time for this Project DESTINY business.<br><br>The next thing that's happening is the kidnap of a SERAPH researcher. We don't have to handle the kidnapping, but we do got to take out a Paragon Police Department blockade set up to intercept them.  Man, I like ripping apart those cops! Once we take out the heavies of the PPD, Ghost Widow's force will only have to deal with the Longbow forces at the SERAPH offices. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over there and take down the heads of the PPD blockade!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3980443630" "Defeat PPD lieutenants and officers"
// SendOffString :
"P466404023" "Hit 'em hard. We need enough of their leaders down so Ghost Widow's main operative can break through to kidnap the SERAPH scientist."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P734557041" "C'mon, get moving! I want to see blood on the streets of Paragon City tonight, either the PPD's blood or yours!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4221580243" "You head over to where the Paragon Police Department blockade was set up. Time to hit 'em hard!"

