// IntroString :
"P3510480421" "Arachnos managed to nab the SERAPH researcher and took 'im back to the Rogue Isles while we were busy tying up the PPD. Arachnos' next target is a former PortalCorp researcher who was lured away by Crey so they could start developing their own portal technology. Again, we gotta tie up the Crey guards while the main extraction team goes in and extracts the second researcher. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>They've protecting the industrial complex with some sort of elite Paragon Protectors. Take 'em down!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1231775297" "Defeat Paragon Protectors and allies"
// SendOffString :
"P879493888" "Paragon Protectors - what a joke! The only thing they're going to be protecting is their bloody entrails!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P637176334" "C'mon, you gotta hit that Crey industrial complex so the other Arachnos team can extract the researcher. Besides, don't you want to pound some Crey faces?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3733172792" "The Arachnos extraction team is waiting on you to take down the Paragon Protectors. Time for some violence!"

