// IntroString :
"P931686" "Looks like we're two for two, {VillainName}. We got the SERAPH researcher and the Crey researcher, now comes the REALLY fun one - a Malta researcher! Once we collect the whole set, we'll have all the brainpower we need for Recluse's pet project. What we have to do is cause a diversion by attacking one of their equipment warehouses here in Grandville. You're gonna go in and start blowing up their equipment so they code red the whole attack and pull their reserves from their base containing the researcher the extraction team needs to nab. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Malta warehouse and start wrecking stuff!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2173966808" "Cause distraction at Malta warehouse"
// SendOffString :
"P1978724051" "I'd send a couple of operatives to help you out, but then they'd pin it directly on Arachnos. Ah well, if you die, you die, right?"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2582102766" "Hit that Malta base now, you little puke! And don't make us look bad!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P874345056" "Malta's been shipping all kinds of equipment throughout the Rogue Isles. Now it's time for them to pay the rent!"

