// IntroString :
"P129903480" "Arachnos is satisfied with our distractions; the extraction teams managed to get a hold of the three portal researchers easily thanks to us! However, Arachnos operatives have reported lots of rumblings coming from Longbow. They're not too happy with us stealing a bunch of the eggheads, and they're gettin' ready for a counterattack - and it's up to us to stop 'em! Longbow is going to be showing up soon, so we'd better be prepared. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to Arachnos Operative Grillo and requisition the last tech goodie to give you an edge!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4180041612" "Get tech support from Grillo"
// SendOffString :
"P1692093286" "Best part of knowin' someone like Arachnos is they have cool toys to play with!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P788735459" "C'mon, get movin'! Those Longbow agents will be showin' up any time now!"

